===Noun===
'''brawn'''

# Strong [[muscle]]s or [[lean]] [[flesh]], especially of the arm, leg or thumb.
# Physical [[strength]]; [[muscularity]].
# {{context|mostly|UK}} A [[terrine]] made from the [[head]] of a [[pig]] or [[calf]]; originally [[boar]]'s meat.

